    {"i":"d5x7j5","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:16px\">","h":"② 甲이 생성한 이미지·이미지파일은 문서<span class=\"cs-x\"><strong>(X)</strong></span> → 공문서변조죄<span class=\"cs-x\"><strong>(X)</strong></span>","k":"krlxly"},
    {"i":"7lyxcp","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:0px\">","h":"<strong>(라) [소결]</strong> 甲 = 공문서변조죄<span class=\"cs-x\"><strong>(X)</strong></span>","k":"jvuyz5"},
